gmeow:UnionRetainedListSourceLaw
    a logic:Constraint ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxTBox ;
    rdfs:label "union retained list source law"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "Every class list retained by the linked output of a QueryCandidateUnion is one of that node’s selected original input lists."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use for the output-to-input direction that excludes unrelated retained lists."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid accepting an extra list merely because it has the same class, ranks or candidate membership as a selected input."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Join the union to its output and each retained list, then require the same list resource as mergeAnswerInput."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "The law constrains linked union outputs; it does not impose list membership or an owner on an otherwise standalone answer."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "A source-list obligation: gmeow:UnionRetainedListSourceLaw logic:formalizes gmeow:unionClassList ."@x-gmeow-english ;
