    gmeow:howToUse "Bind the stored kind and boolean direction, then require logic:termEqual to typed false for tier or tie and typed true for score or activation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "The law checks declaration agreement only. It neither compares candidate magnitudes nor certifies that a consumer implemented the policy sequence."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Explicit admitted directions: ex:tierKey gmeow:orderDescending \"false\"^^xsd:boolean . ex:scoreKey gmeow:orderDescending \"true\"^^xsd:boolean ."@x-gmeow-english ;
