    gmeow:useWhen "Use to describe weighted fusion separately from the existing unweighted integer operator."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid treating the node description as an execution, fitting procedure, ordering policy or permission to broaden ReciprocalRankFusion."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Link the actual reported application through executesQueryNode and retain the complete coefficient, contribution, score and declared-sum account on that occurrence."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "The selected application uses the weighted scale-eighteen source convention. Declared decimal summation does not certify raw fixed-point admission, rank truncation or native execution."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:weightedNode a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusion . Its inherited effect and stratum bindings are omitted here."@x-gmeow-english ;
    logic:subClassOf gmeow:QueryProgramNode .

