    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxTBox ;
    rdfs:label "Query Weighted Fusion Application"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "A consumer-reported successful weighted-fusion occurrence joining one original union, one answer occurrence, one selected profile interpretation, explicit measured status and complete applied quantitative evidence."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use to associate an actual reported call and result with the selected source-profile interpretation and original evidence identities."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid fabricating an empty successful answer for a failed call, authenticating a source by declaration or inventing a second execution for the ordering returned by the same native result."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Supply executesQueryNode, weightedFusionInput, weightedFusionOutput, weightedFusionProfile, weightedFusionMeasured and every actual coefficient, score and applicable full fit."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "A successful empty union retains its nonempty declared class set and coefficients. Partial recall retains its original loss and completeness evidence. Source authentication and native arithmetic remain separate requirements."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:call a gmeow:QueryWeightedFusionApplication ; gmeow:executesQueryNode ex:weightedNode . Other required occurrence bindings are omitted."@x-gmeow-english ;
