    gmeow:useWhen "Use to retain exactly one activation record for every original applied score and no unrelated score."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid omitting candidates, sharing one record across accounts or confusing an empty original union with an empty vault roster."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Reference every QueryCandidateActivationRecord and retain its actual applied score and nonempty found-vault scope."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "This collection is empty exactly when the existing application’s score collection is empty. Original query, candidate and loss identities remain governed by the weighted account."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:account gmeow:activationCandidateRecord ex:row . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."@x-gmeow-english ;
