    skos:scopeNote "Every selected account has at least one roster member. Candidate found-vault membership is a separate nonempty subset, not the entire roster. Ambiguous capture absence blocks this complete import."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:account gmeow:activationVaultRecord ex:vaultA, ex:vaultB . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."@x-gmeow-english ;
