gmeow:reportedActivationValue
    a logic:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://blackcatinformatics.ca/gmeow/slices/query-program> ;
    gmeow:graphBoxRole gmeow:boxRBox ;
    rdfs:label "reported aggregate activation value"@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:definition "The at-most-one actual reported aggregate activation Quantity of a candidate record, required exactly when its account selected activation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:useWhen "Use to retain a true reported zero or positive aggregate without claiming component recomputation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:avoidWhen "Avoid writing the disabled source constant zero as a measured Quantity or summing snapshot held counts as candidate activation."@x-gmeow-english ;
    gmeow:howToUse "Reference one fully coordinated QueryReportedActivation when activationEnabled is true; omit this edge when false."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:scopeNote "All found vaults with qualified first-snapshot absence imply numeric zero. The converse is false: a real present snapshot may estimate zero. Per-vault candidate components are not exported by the inspected public Fused result."@x-gmeow-english ;
    skos:example "Fictional scoped fragment: ex:row gmeow:reportedActivationValue ex:activation . Other required account bindings and source admission evidence are omitted."@x-gmeow-english ;
